WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.135
Is he running or is he just running?

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.871
Welcome to Unfiltered. I'm S.E. Cupp.

00:00:04.871 --> 00:00:05.505
Florida Governor

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:06.473
Ron DeSantis

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:07.707
is presumed

00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:10.343
to be mounting a run for president

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:11.011
but lately

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.278
it seems more like he's

00:00:12.278 --> 00:00:15.081
just running from Florida.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.616
Florida is facing several crises

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:17.484
at the moment.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.652
Last week's One in a thousand year

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:21.788
weather event saw severe flooding

00:00:22.088 --> 00:00:23.723
throughout the southern part of the state

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.326
and also resulted in a gas shortage.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.695
But the Santos was two states

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:30.063
away on Wednesday

00:00:30.063 --> 00:00:31.664
talking to South Carolina voters

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.467
about fighting wokeness last week.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:35.735
While many parts of Florida

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:37.137
were underwater

00:00:37.137 --> 00:00:37.971
and DeSantis

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.539
declared a state of emergency

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.107
for Broward County.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:43.143
He went to Ohio to continue

00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:45.078
to promote his book

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:47.280
that caught the eye of Donald Trump Jr,

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:48.848
who dinged the governor

00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:50.350
for traveling quote,

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:52.318
instead of taking care of the people

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.354
suffering in his state.

00:00:54.354 --> 00:00:55.422
While Democratic State

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:56.322
Senator Chevron

00:00:56.322 --> 00:00:57.991
Jones called it

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:58.892
disgraceful

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.960
and telling about his priorities,

00:01:01.494 --> 00:01:02.862
he has failed as a leader.

00:01:02.862 --> 00:01:06.066
Jones said it's unclear whether DeSantis

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.967
his national book tour is irking

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:09.135
Florida voters.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:10.737
But polling has former

00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:11.738
President Donald Trump

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:13.740
increasing his lead over

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:16.042
DeSantis in a hypothetical matchup

00:01:16.042 --> 00:01:18.711
in their home state and nationally.

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:20.480
DeSantis this culture war on Disney

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:22.682
also seems to be doing him no favors.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:23.516
Fellow Republicans

00:01:23.516 --> 00:01:25.118
are even calling it out.

00:01:25.118 --> 00:01:25.785
Chris Christie,

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.053
the former New Jersey governor,

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:29.355
says DeSantis is being outfoxed

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:31.591
by Disney chief Bob Iger.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.459
That's not the guy

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:33.960
I want sitting across from Chinese

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.395
President Xi Jinping

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:35.895
or Russian

00:01:35.895 --> 00:01:37.297
President Vladimir Putin

00:01:37.297 --> 00:01:38.198
trying to resolve

00:01:38.198 --> 00:01:39.766
what's happening in Ukraine.

00:01:39.766 --> 00:01:41.101
If you can't see around a corner

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.836
that Bob Iger creates for you,

00:01:42.836 --> 00:01:43.636
I mean, I don't think

00:01:43.636 --> 00:01:45.905
that's very imposing, said Christie.

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:46.473
He also said

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:47.674
telling private corporations

00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:49.809
what to do isn't very conservative.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:51.678
And Fox Business host

00:01:51.678 --> 00:01:52.579
Larry Kudlow warned

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.680
the dissenters was close

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.081
to making a fool of himself

00:01:55.081 --> 00:01:57.083
with his Walt Disney obsession.

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:58.017
Indeed, DeSantis

00:01:58.017 --> 00:01:59.719
even suggested putting a prison next

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.288
to Disney for some reason.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.424
These recent missteps really undercut

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:07.127
DeSantis, his own heavily crafted persona

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:09.729
and presumed Cabinet campaign platform,

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:11.064
which is that

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:13.233
he stays above the fray out of the drama

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:15.668
and is hard at work for Florida.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:17.203
Remember these quotes

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:17.871
last month

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:18.771
as Trump was facing

00:02:18.771 --> 00:02:19.873
an indictment for his role

00:02:19.873 --> 00:02:20.974
in the handling of hush money

00:02:20.974 --> 00:02:22.308
payments to Sanders

00:02:22.308 --> 00:02:24.177
bragged, The way we run the government,

00:02:24.177 --> 00:02:26.246
I think, is no daily drama

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:27.680
focused on the big picture

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:29.849
and put points on the board.

00:02:29.849 --> 00:02:31.117
When asked about Trump's

00:02:31.117 --> 00:02:32.385
nicknames for him,

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:33.453
he insisted,

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:34.921
It's not important for me

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:35.455
to be fighting

00:02:35.455 --> 00:02:37.190
with people on social media.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.058
It's not accomplishing anything for

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.560
the people I represent,

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.363
but I'm betting floods and

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.365
gas shortages are important

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:47.233
to the people he represents.

00:02:47.233 --> 00:02:48.168
But no matter

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:49.402
He also insisted

00:02:49.402 --> 00:02:49.736
he wouldn't

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:50.403
get involved

00:02:50.403 --> 00:02:52.372
in some manufactured circus

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:54.073
like Trump's indictment.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.408
But one could certainly argue

00:02:55.408 --> 00:02:58.044
that his foolish war on Disney

00:02:58.044 --> 00:02:58.778
is just that

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:01.281
a manufactured circus of his own making.

00:03:02.248 --> 00:03:02.715
I'm not sure

00:03:02.715 --> 00:03:04.384
what exactly de Santos is doing,

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:05.185
but when it comes to

00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:06.920
his presidential prospects,

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.488
it isn't working.

00:03:08.521 --> 00:03:09.856
For a guy who is no drama

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:10.890
and fighting for Florida,

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.192
he certainly seems to be

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:13.560
courting the drama

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:15.995
and leaving Floridians behind

00:03:15.995 --> 00:03:17.597
the cherry on top

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:19.532
Trump is racking up the endorsements

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:21.401
from Republican lawmakers

00:03:21.401 --> 00:03:23.102
in their home state.

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:24.704
That's it for me. See you next week.

